              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <table>
                  <tr>
                    <td>Independent Parliamentary Expenses Authority, in relation to:
(a) documents requesting that the Authority give personal advice under paragraph 12(1)(a) or (p) of the Independent Parliamentary Expenses Authority Act 2017; and
(b) any other documents that concern the performance of a function conferred on the Authority by paragraph 12(1)(a) or (p) of that Act.</td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
